        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we offer a number of traditional convenience store services, including lottery, prepaid products, gift cards, money orders, ATMs, skill gaming, Bitcoin® ATMs and other ancillary product and service offerings.",
        "start_character": 5743,
        "end_character": 5965
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071464",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071464-0dda9893557b9047",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071464",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we operate a fleet fueling business that included the operation of 295 proprietary and third-party cardlock locations (unstaffed fueling locations), as of December 31, 2025, and the issuance of proprietary fuel cards that provide customers access to a nationwide network of fueling sites.",
        "start_character": 891,
        "end_character": 1193
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071464",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071464-0dda9893557b9047",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071464",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Following the APC IPO, we provide management services and certain related services to APC, including by our executive management team.",
        "start_character": 31197,
        "end_character": 31331
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071464",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071464-0dda9893557b9047",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071464",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our benefits offerings are competitive in the markets in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 34217,
        "end_character": 34302
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071464",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071464-0dda9893557b9047",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071464",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our business model provides us with strategic flexibility to acquire chains with retail, dealer and cardlock locations.",
        "start_character": 19296,
        "end_character": 19431
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071464",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071464-0dda9893557b9047",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071464",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We license various marks in relation to the branded fuels that we supply, including “ExxonMobil,” “Marathon,” “BP,” “Shell,” and “Valero.” In our quick service food offerings, we license trademarks such as “Subway” and “Dunkin’” to use at our applicable franchised or licensed outlets.",
        "start_character": 35417,
        "end_character": 35702
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071464",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071464-0dda9893557b9047",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071464",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We supplement our foodservice offering with approximately 90 quick service major national brand restaurants, such as Dunkin’ and Subway.",
        "start_character": 5606,
        "end_character": 5742
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071464",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071464-0dda9893557b9047",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071464",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "By aligning training with role-specific expectations, we seek to ensure operational consistency and long-term workforce development.",
        "start_character": 32953,
        "end_character": 33085
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071464",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071464-0dda9893557b9047",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071464",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In the wholesale segment, we supply fuel to third-parties both at sites owned or leased by dealers, sites that we own or for which we have a long-term lease, and bulk and spot purchasers.",
        "start_character": 23295,
        "end_character": 23482
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071464",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071464-0dda9893557b9047",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071464",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our environmental department maintains direct interaction with federal, state and local environmental agencies across all jurisdictions in which we operate so that we remain informed of regulatory developments and to promote compliance with evolving environmental standards.",
        "start_character": 30344,
        "end_character": 30618
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071464",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071464-0dda9893557b9047",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071464",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Over the past few years, we have been developing role-specific training programs (“targeted training programs”) to provide structured employee development opportunities, strengthen role clarity, enhance compliance and accelerate readiness across key operational roles.",
        "start_character": 32339,
        "end_character": 32607
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071464",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071464-0dda9893557b9047",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071464",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Wage rates in the markets in which we operate, including voluntary increases in wages because of current labor market conditions, have increased our costs associated with recruiting and retaining qualified personnel, and expect to continue to do so in the future.",
        "start_character": 33821,
        "end_character": 34084
      }
